                <invention-title lang="de">REINIGUNGSVORRICHTUNG UND STEUERUNGSVERFAHREN DAFÜR, BASISSTATION UND SYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL DE NETTOYAGE ET SON PROCÉDÉ DE COMMANDE, STATION DE BASE ET SYSTÈME</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CLEANING APPARATUS AND CONTROL METHOD THEREOF, BASE STATION, AND SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A cleaning apparatus and a control method thereof, a base station, and a system are provided in embodiments of the disclosure. The cleaning system includes a cleaning apparatus for cleaning a surface to be cleaned, the cleaning apparatus includes a first energy storage and a first electrical connector connected with the first energy storage; and a first base station configured to be in cooperation with the cleaning apparatus, the first base station comprises a second electrical connector and a power consumer, the first base station is configured to: without connecting to a socket; in case the cleaning apparatus is docked with the first base station to couple the first electrical connector with the second electrical connector, the first energy storage is capable of supplying power to the first base station through the first electrical connector and the second electrical connector.</p>
            </abstract>
